[ti:Tiɣṛi n yemma]
[ar:Nna Aldjia]
[al:Tiɣṛi n Yemma]
[length:3:00]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:10.59] Bqa ɛla xir tamurt-iw
[00:12.93] Ihujer ul-iw
[00:19.07] Tikkelt-a abrid ad neḥcer
[00:26.95] A yi-iɣaḍen d leḥbab-iw
[00:29.42] Ad ctiqen udem-iw
[00:35.36] Ass n lɛid deg leɛwacer
[00:42.69] Dɛut ad yezhu wul-iw
[00:45.35] Teɛmer texṛidt-iw
[00:50.69] Win yeḥya ṛebbi ad nemẓer
[00:57.09]
[01:07.49] A yemma ur neḥdir
[01:09.95] Ayen ur neḥdir
[01:15.80] Ass-mi t-wwten di Micli
[01:23.59] Lwennas izem aɣilas
[01:25.97] Ṛẓan-t deg wammas
[01:31.26] Yemma-s tebɛed ur telli
[01:39.15] Deg uxxam yeɣli-d leḥzen
[01:41.51] Iẓṛi-w yettru-d
[01:46.92] Ɛemmren-t siwa lbeṛṛani
[01:51.80]
[02:00.50] Ay imjuhad irkelli
[02:02.61] Ɣur-wen nettɛenni
[02:08.68] Isebbalen n idammen-nsen
[02:16.36] Ttrun warrac di l'Paris
[02:18.67] Ccedhan l'Algérie
[02:24.30] Ccɣel ṛẓag ad txedmeɣ
[02:31.52] Kul lǧens yesɛa akersi
[02:33.68] Tura ula d nekkni
[02:39.10] Tamaziɣt nneɣ tbeggen
[02:45.28]